  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tech Skills&amp;Jobs for 1000 Underserved Youth-Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This initiative will provide access to quality digital skills training for 1,000 young people from underprivileged backgrounds from 4 regions in Kenya.The program will also focus on empowering persons with disabilities, girls, and young women, who are often marginalized and face discrimination. It will also help these young people develop the skills they need to succeed in the digital economy, improve their socio-economic status, and make a difference in their communities.</narrative>
  </description>
